{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and take the object, check its properties or move to the destination for specific task accordingly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
